    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="28cb624c-4e7d-5268-8955-ebfd230fa478" activityNameId="4b00f220-3c85-55dc-81b2-fa07a1baf3de" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen sulphide, H2S, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen sulphide, H2S, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of gaseous hydrogen sulphide. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process and missing data on process emissions.;
CAS number: 007783-06-4; 
Formula: H2S; 
Synonyms: monosulfane; 
UUID: c4fb13df-afca-31f0-a6bc-c7e552b6020a
Raw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Solid wastes and emissions to air/water (except waste heat) omitted.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin. Average European processes for raw materials, transport requirements and electricity mix used.
Technology: Production from sulphur and hydrogen. Inventory bases on literature values.
Time period: data of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature. Energy demand based on approximation from large chemical plant. 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c4fb13df-afca-31f0-a6bc-c7e552b6020a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
